 snakeduel:['75 seconds','slither.io style, both at once: P1 steers on the left half, P2 on the right. Hold and drag like a joystick; the snake turns toward your drag, and dragging far boosts (it burns length). Eat orbs to grow and score. If your head touches the other snake you burst into orbs and your rival gets +50. Walls are deadly.'],
 tank:['first to 7','Atari 2600 Combat (Tank-Pong), both at once. Hold and drag on your own side like a joystick: your tank turns toward the drag and rolls forward. Tap to fire (or tap a second finger while driving). Shells ricochet off walls twice; a hit sends the tank spinning. First to 7 hits, or most after 90 seconds.'],
 artillery:['8 shots each','Scorched Earth on Klendathu, taking turns. Drag back anywhere and let go: the opposite direction is your angle, the drag length your power; a short tracer shows the start of the arc. The wind changes every shot and the dirt craters and collapses. One Baby Nuke each. Three armour bars: 25 a bar, +60 to destroy the other tank, +15 per bug.'],
 dualrace:['best of 3','A real drag race, both at once: Charger (left half) vs Supra (right half). Hold your half to rev and keep the needle in the green, then let go on the green light (early is a red light). Tap your half to shift when the needle reaches the shift zone; perfect shifts give a kick. Swipe up once per race for NOS. Lowest time wins the race; best of three.'],
 sumo:['first to 3','A top-down sumo bout on a real dohyo, both at once (P1 left half, P2 right half). Hold and drag like a joystick to shuffle your inflatable suit; a quick tap is a slap-charge with a short cooldown. Push the other suit out of the straw ring. The ring tightens if a bout drags on. First to three bouts.'],
 sword2p:['escape twice','A Nidhogg-style duel in the House of Blue Leaves, both at once (P1 left half, P2 right half). Drag left/right to walk, swipe up/down to hold your sword high, middle or low, tap to thrust. A thrust at the same height as your rival\'s sword is parried; anything else kills. A kill gives you the right of way: run for your exit (P1 right, P2 left). Escape twice to win.'],
 moneygrab:['Until you\'re out (online: together)','Tapper at the Bluths\' bars (Arrested Development look), no clock: levels get longer and faster until your three lives are gone, score adds up. Tap a bar to slide the order down it (frozen banana, vodka martini, hot ham water); customers are random characters who sometimes talk. They get shoved back, eat or drink, then slide the empty back for you to catch at that bar (+100). Shove one out the door for +50, tap loose cash for +150, serve everyone to open the next bar (+tip jar). An unserved order, a dropped empty or a customer reaching you costs a life; three lives. Online you both work the same room at once, and anyone you shove out walks over to the other player\'s bars.'],
 battleroyale:['best of 3','The film\'s rules, both at once (P1 left half, P2 right half). Drag like a joystick to move, tap to attack: the aim locks onto your classmate but trees and the school block shots. Supply bags hold a sickle, crossbow, Uzi or shotgun. Every few seconds new DANGER ZONES are announced; stay in one when it closes and your collar explodes. Three hearts; best of three rounds.'],
 bondmission:['80s each','A top-down GoldenEye Facility stealth run, taking turns on the same layout. Drag like a joystick to sneak out of the bathroom and through the plant; tap a guard to take him down (karate chop up close, silenced PP7 from range, 8 bullets). Stay out of the vision cones or the alarm sends every guard after you. Intel disks +100, takedowns +25/40, reaching the exit +200 plus time and stealth bonuses.'],
 minichess:['turn based','Gardner minichess on a 5×5 holo board: king, queen, rook, bishop, knight and five pawns each, with real check, checkmate and stalemate. Pawns move one square and promote to a queen. Tap a piece to see its legal moves, then tap a highlighted square. 45 seconds a move.'],
 minigolf:['3 holes','Sitabout Mini Golf: pro-style putt-putt with your head as the ball. Drag back from anywhere and let go: the dotted guide shows where the ball starts and its first bounce, the ring shows power; pull into the red for a wild Happy Gilmore drive. Real slopes and hills, rails, ramps and jumps, sand, water and drop-offs (+1 stroke), windmills, the clown\'s mouth, gators, gophers, bumpers, portals, trampolines and boost pads. The player farther from the cup putts next. Par names, a real scorecard, a hidden lost ball on every hole. Fewest strokes wins.'],
 curling:['2 ends','Olympic curling, taking turns: four stones each per end, two ends. Tap ↺/↻ to pick the turn, then drag back from anywhere and let go (direction is the line, length the weight). While your stone slides, rub the screen to sweep: it travels further and curls less. Stones must pass the red hog line. Only the closest side scores, one point per stone nearer than the rival\'s best.'],
 baseball:['Ten outs each','A Home Run Derby in the Ken Griffey-style batting view: ten outs each against batting-practice pitches. Drag on the left to move around the batter’s box, tap SWING on the right as the ball arrives (flick up to lift it): early pulls it, late goes the other way. Any swing that is not a home run is an out, so is a called strike. Most home runs wins.'],
 duckturn:['10 ducks each','NES Duck Hunt with your rival\'s head on every duck, taking turns on the same flight patterns. Tap a duck to shoot it: two at a time, three shots per pair, ten ducks a round. Wait too long and they fly away. Black 500, blue 1000, red 1500; hit all ten for a 10,000 PERFECT bonus.'],
 brawler:['75s each','A Streets of Rage style beat \'em up on the Warriors\' walk home to Coney Island, taking turns on the same waves. Hold and drag like a joystick to walk (up/down moves in depth), tap to punch (the third hit of a combo knocks down), flick for a flying kick. Baseball Furies, Punks and Orphans wear your rival\'s head. KOs score; reaching Coney Island adds a time bonus.'],
 darts:['one match','Three games at Paddy’s: 301 (count down to exactly zero), Rickety Cricket’s Cricket (close 20 to 15 and the bull) and High Score. Hold a finger to aim, the sight wobbles, let go to throw. Treble ring ×3, double ring ×2, outer bull 25, bullseye 50.'],
 pong:['first to 7','Atari 1972, two humans at once. Drag on your own side to move your paddle (left/right on a wide screen, bottom/top on a phone held upright). Where the ball meets the paddle sets the angle, and the ball speeds up after 4 and 12 hits. First to 7.'],
 tictactoe:['first to 2','Tic-tac-toe on the WOPR where each player keeps only three heads: your fourth move erases your oldest. No draws. First to two games wins.']
